{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fc1b00d2-df8e-8872-b02e-7d47da28fbf1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T12:20:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:17:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:17:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Kevin. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Gino Santoro. I am calling for my mother, she lives on Chapel Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem. Go ahead, what's going on over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. There is a hole in the road, a pothole, in front of her house. It is [inaudible] very close to the crosswalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:18:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a pothole near a crosswalk. Sorry, you're on speaker and you cut out a little. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:18:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, yes, I am on the speaker, my hands are busy. The address is 440 Chapel Street. In the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "440 Chapel Street, got it. And how big is the hole, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:18:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is about two feet across. Maybe a little more on one side. It is not so deep, but a tire can fall inside, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:18:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, two feet across, that'll rattle a car. Writing that down. Anything else out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:18:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one more thing, if you permit me. The paint of the crosswalk has faded, almost you cannot see it. And the cars, they do not stop for my mother when she crosses. [line breaks up] she waits and waits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so faded crosswalk paint and cars not stopping. I'll put that in the same ticket so the right crew sees both. Faded paint is a different crew from the pothole, but it'll all go in together."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, that is very kind. Excuse me, may I ask, how long the repairs usually take? For the pothole, I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:19:26-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually it's a matter of days to a couple weeks, depending on how many are ahead of it. This time of year with the freeze and thaw we get a lot of them. The line painting is more of a warmer-weather job, so that one can wait longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. The weather, yes. Okay. [pause] Also I am sorry, it is not about the road, but I am waiting for a tax refund, and I hope it arrives before January. So I am a little distracted today. Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Well, we're in February, so hopefully it's on its way. Let me just read this back. Pothole, about two feet across, 440 Chapel Street near the crosswalk, plus faded crosswalk paint where cars aren't stopping. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Do you want a callback number on this, in case it's easier for you than your mom?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, use mine. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one seven nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-nine. Got it. Name again was Gino?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Gino Santoro. S-A-N-T-O-R-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You're all set, Gino. It's in the system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Kevin. You are very gentle. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:20:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
